# headwear/helm/nasal_legend: the CONE family grown at T5-T6
# (HELMS wave 2, round 1; PLAN D44 D68, STYLE_P2 29.4 / 29.10) the T5-T6 growth of the helm family `fam.cone` on a culture
# alloy, drawn from the helm's own crown mark (placed on the head anchor at each variant's mark), so every variant keeps its outline and grows from its own
# crown: T5 the point sheds a horsetail (a drawn crest raised: the knife and spike taller, a horsehair on the ridge, feathers round the orb); T6 behind heraldic gilt wings.
# Written by the HELMS area tools/grow.py from src/designs.py (D and R drawn; U is D; L is R mirrored and re-lit; lie = L).
# The `!crest-<v>` terms step aside for the crests drawn on this family: a drawn crest grows itself (helm/crest/*.pxm).
use person
body adult
role helm fam.cone
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
z 1
tags overlay
legend X glow 3
legend W glow 4
legend J metal2 0
legend Q metal2 4
legend F plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4
